    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The railroad reached Wayland in April 1914, and the town’s post office opened the next month on May 18.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wayland%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wayland began as a company town of the Elk Horn Coal Corporation, built to house miners extracting rich Appalachian coal seams.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
